ediction markets put Democratic odds near one in ten. The race is best characterized as Likely Republican, with some chance of a closer-than-expected result in a low-information open seat.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.087, "margin": -8.61}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.093, "margin": -9.5}]}